    "title": "Bridging History, History Heritage and Travel : Experience History Through Gullah Theater in the Lowcountry - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michiel Perry ,\n13 hours ago As our nation marks the Semiquincentennial—the 250th anniversary of American Independence—the narrative of our country’s founding is being expanded, enriched, and reclaimed right here in the South Carolina Lowcountry. This summer, history is not just being read; it is being felt, heard, and honored through the powerful theatrical artistry of the Gullah Traveling Theater, Inc. (GTTI). Read full article",
